      "widgets_values": [
        "The first parameters I tweak to improve output:\n\nIn the Text Encoder CFG can range from 2 to 15 and it seems each model weight or LM weight might require different strength completly.\n\nAlso \"temperature\" can range between anywhere between 0.2 to 1. \n\nIn the ksampler steps (8 for turbo and 50-80 for SFT and Base) and CFG between 1 and 5 (1 is usually enough)\n\nOther parameters to look at are  top_p, top_k and the lora loader parameters.\n\nWorth playing with these parameters to get best output"
